<section class="sectionhead"><div><div class="eyebrow">DECISION READINESS</div><h2>Every requirement: what blocks it, what clears it</h2></div><span class="tag">SNAPSHOT 2026-11-14</span></section>
<section class="content">
  <div class="note"><b>One row per requirement.</b> State is taken from the <a href="pages/requirements.html">requirements register</a>; the gate is the pre-registered condition in <a href="docs/methodology/validation-gates.md">validation-gates.md</a> and <a href="data/gates.json">data/gates.json</a>; the clearing number is the threshold that must be reached before the requirement can be treated as done. Rows already met list their evidence. Items that depend on an owner decision not yet taken are left blank and flagged rather than guessed.</div>
